*.suo

# Kit assets that Tools/make-kit-assets.ps1 REGENERATES. They are outputs, not source: the
# commandlet rebuilds them from the committed C++, and this project's rule is that a generated
# fixture is restored rather than tracked. Named one by one rather than by a wildcard, because
# TA01, TA07, TA11, TA13 and TA22 are hand-made and ARE tracked.
Content/Tests/Kit/TA14_KitDataTable.uasset
Content/Tests/Kit/TA17_KitCurveFloat.uasset
Content/Tests/Kit/TA17_KitCurveTable.uasset
Content/Tests/Kit/TA20_KitParameters.uasset

# Fixtures a generated round leaves behind, suffixed with the round number.
# The suites RESTORE what they touch, but an interrupted or exploratory run can leave one, and a
# repository that shows them as untracked invites the next person to commit them - which is how
# four of them reached a commit once already.
Content/Tests/TA*_R[0-9]*.uasset
